#   This supersedes the former single-user/UTF-8 risk acceptance: these are
#   fixed defects, not accepted exposure. The old pin's 2.42-84 patch also
#   contains all six fixes; the pin advance additionally clears other packages.
#   Review again on its own Wednesday, 2026-11-25; delete if the NVD ranges
#   stop matching or vulnix learns to recognize the aggregate patch.
Expiration: 2026-11-25
